# Generated by idf.py; also the file your Wi-Fi and MQTT passwords end up in.
#
# The wildcard is deliberate. /sdkconfig and /sdkconfig.old were listed
# individually, which missed sdkconfig.bak -- written by the configure script
# as a backup of the file it is about to overwrite. That copy is harmless the
# first time (it backs up the placeholders) and holds live credentials every
# time after. Match the whole family instead of guessing the suffixes.
/build/
/sdkconfig
/sdkconfig.*

# ...but sdkconfig.defaults is checked-in project configuration with no
# secrets in it, and must survive the rule above.
!/sdkconfig.defaults
